{"id":"H5738","lemma":"עֶ֫דֶר","transliteration":"eder","sayIt":"e-der","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Eder","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1Ch.8.15;\nson of: Beriah (H1283I);\nbrother of: Arad (H6166B), Ahio (H0283H), Shashak (H8349), Jeremoth (H3406I), Zebadiah (H2069), Michael (H4317L), Ishpah (H3472) and Joha (H3109)\n§ Ader = \"flock\"\n1) a Benjamite, son of Beriah, chief of the inhabitants of Aijalon\n1a) also 'Eder'","glosses":["eder"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Eder","kjv":"and Ader"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:15","note":"Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0283","lemma":"אַחְיוֹ","transliteration":"achyo","gloss":"Ahio"},{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","gloss":"Beriah"},{"id":"H2069","lemma":"זְבַדְיָהוּ","transliteration":"zevadyah","gloss":"Zebadiah"},{"id":"H3109","lemma":"יוֹחָא","transliteration":"yoach","gloss":"Joha"},{"id":"H3406","lemma":"יְרִימוֹת","transliteration":"yerimot","gloss":"Jerimoth"},{"id":"H3472","lemma":"יִשְׁפָּה","transliteration":"yishpah","gloss":"Ishpah"},{"id":"H4317","lemma":"מִיכָאֵל","transliteration":"mikhael","gloss":"Michael"},{"id":"H6166","lemma":"עֲרָד","transliteration":"arad","gloss":"Arad"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}